# Logging

Use `logger` from `utils/logger.ts`. Never use `console.*` directly.

```typescript
import { logger } from '../utils/logger';

logger.error('Failed to load threads', error);
logger.warn('WebSocket reconnecting');
logger.info('User logged in', { userId });
logger.debug('API response', { data });
```

The only file allowed to use `console.*` is `utils/logger.ts` itself.
